From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ruskin Constant <ruskin@cloudflare.com>
Date: Wed, 16 Sep 2026 11:27:20 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Enable word-break: break-word in the servo build

BreakWord was cfg(feature = "gecko")-gated even though it's a compat
alias (the doc comment already spells out the compat rule: behaves as
word-break normal plus overflow-wrap anywhere). No gecko-only machinery
backs the variant. Un-gate it; the servo-side compat rewrite lands as a
blitz-dom patch.
---
 values/specified/text.rs | 1 -
 1 file changed, 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/values/specified/text.rs b/values/specified/text.rs
index c4284cb..181eede 100644
--- a/values/specified/text.rs
+++ b/values/specified/text.rs
@@ -856,6 +856,5 @@ pub enum WordBreak {
     ///
     /// Specifying `word-break: break-word` makes `overflow-wrap` behave as
     /// `anywhere`, and `word-break` behave like `normal`.
-    #[cfg(feature = "gecko")]
     BreakWord,
 }
